WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:31.870
No way!

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:36.960
How..? How could this happen?!

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.050
It was a total defeat...

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.800
No, it's not over yet.

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.280
Takao can... Takao can surely make it..!

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:52.890
We're still tied. The score is yet to be settled!

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.840
The real fight starts now!

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:03.350
It's useless. We've already analyzed your emotions, Dragoon's stats, everything.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:09.240
They will never ever be able
to win against us—the PPB.

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:14.720
The goddess of victory will shine upon us.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:24.640
As long as we have the data, victory will be ours. You should understand this now, Max.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:27.760
You have no chance of winning.

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.540
Mama...

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:34.120
It's the first set in the finals,
and the players are tied 1-1.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.880
Everything will be decided by this next final battle!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:51.430
The Scalding Hot Scorpion!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:56.400
Time for he last battle of the first set! Who will claim victory and conquer the championship?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:00.240
Will it be Kinomiya? Or maybe Steve?

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:04.170
A battle which will reveal
their true strength is about to begin!

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:08.030
Go, Takao! Show them the warrior's spirit!

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:11.410
I'm expecting great things from you, Kinomiya-kun.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.650
Takso, fight!

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:23.110
If we want to outsmart the PPB, who has already analyzed Dragoon, we must analyze Tryhorn and find its weakness.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:27.580
It's useless. No matter how much you struggle, you can't beat scientific power.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:28.990
Steve.

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:31.180
It's time to end this.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:32.180
Okay.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.900
You might have your data or whatever, but there's no way I'm gonna lose to that crap!

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:41.960
Here we go! Are you ready for the the final battle?

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:44.240
Three, Two, One!

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:47.060
Go... Shoot!

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:04.780
Oh? Even after being crushed, you still want to fight?

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.340
You've got guts.

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:08.140
Dragoon!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.820
It's useless! Useless!

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:14.770
We already know everything your Bey can do!

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:16.160
Tryhorn!

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.260
The two contestants have clashed once again!

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:24.440
Oh! Tryhorn's pushing back Dragoon's offense without even flinching!

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:26.870
Will Dragoon be able to resist?

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.730
Takao!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.700
Professor, what are you waiting for?! We have to cheer on Takao!

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.260
This..!

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.260
Professor?

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.590
The results of my analysis came back.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:40.800
Tryhorn... Tryhorn has no weaknesses!

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:47.020
Attack power, defence power, rotation power... every single aspect is flawless!

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:50.560
Taking down that Beyblade is impossible!

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:52.940
That can't be..!

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.820
What's wrong? Can't move?

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:03.400
Get a grip, Dragoon! You're not the type who'd lose to this guy!

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:08.400
The final battle has become completely one-sided! Dragoon is in danger!

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:10.040
Takao! Hide!

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.040
Eh?!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.180
You have to hide!

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:13.080
B-But..!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.340
Just do as I say! Do you want to lose?!

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.040
Dragoon!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.220
That's right. All you can do now is hide.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.430
But that won't help you, either!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.880
What? Where did he go?!

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:42.390
Why you..!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.570
Keep it up, Dragoon!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:51.300
Just give up already! How long do you think you can keep running?!

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:08.820
Oh! Dragoon is making use of the buildings to dodge Tryhorn's attack!

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.470
A completely new tactic from Kinomiya!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:13.800
Takao has abandoned his usual strategy!

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:14.960
It'll be fine.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:19.160
Since they have data on him, he just needs to use a strategy they don't have data on.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:24.470
If the opponents become agitated and Steve loses his cool, Takao might have a shot at winning.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.000
Curse you... Stop squirming!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:33.950
Oh?

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:37.720
I see. They're using a strategy
outside of our current dataset.

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:44.040
Steve's adrenaline secretion is going over 1.0. Consequently, he is losing his focus.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:46.750
His bad habits are coming out again.

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.240
Steve, calm down.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:52.240
I'll send you the new simulation data right now.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:58.800
I understand, Director. How foolish of me... I was about to fall for their cheap tricks.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.700
Tryhorn stopped moving..!

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:04.280
Tsk!

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:11.470
Our simulation's data of battle patterns drawn from your revised analysis is ready.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:14.280
Steve, I'm sending it over, okay?

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:18.280
Roger.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:23.690
What now? Steve is smiling! What is he planning?

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:26.920
Easy. I'm putting an end to this game of hide and seek.

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:43.420
W-What..?!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:48.310
A-Amazing, Tryhorn! He tore down the buildings one after another!

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:51.090
Dragoon has nowhere left to hide!

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:55.830
Hey. It's been a while.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.940
It's hopeless!

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:02.880
So I guess it's game over for you, <i>Japanese Boy</i>.

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:05.520
Go, Death Rush!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.310
Endure, Dragoon! You have to resist!

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:14.680
Don't try to go against it.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.680
Follow the flow.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.120
The flow..?

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:30.030
Follow the flow...

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.220
I see!

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.150
Dragoon!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.120
What?!

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:55.250
The two Beys are sticking together!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.480
What's going on?!

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:59.140
That's... I see!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:04.730
By blocking Tryhorn's attack directly, Takao is increasing Dragoon's rotational speed!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:05.890
Eh?

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:14.400
By doing so, Dragoon can stick to it without being blown away, thus absorbing Tryhorn's power!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:21.920
Right! It's like a cowboy that drains a bull's strength by sticking close to him, rending its horns useless!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:24.010
<i>Wonderful!</i> You're amazing, Takao!

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:31.020
Get off! Get the heck off!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.440
Follow the flow, huh..?

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.010
Now I get it.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.990
He finally snapped.

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:45.820
What an idiot.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:48.980
Steve is losing control.

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:52.810
Calm down, Steve. I'll send you the new data.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:58.030
His perceptive ability is going
down. He's getting out of control. Director, this is dangerous!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:01.160
Can you hear me, Steve? Answer me!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.280
Steve?! Steve!

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.330
Shut up, will ya?!

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:13.830
This is it, Dragoon! Phantom Hurricane!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.660
Tryhorn is out of the stadium!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:42.720
The winner is Kinomiya!

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:47.510
Incredible! A comeback victory in the eleventh hour!

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:48.840
Alright!

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:53.290
He won! We won against the PPB at the finals!

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:54.640
<i>Bravo!</i>

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.190
You did great, Takao!
As expected from my grandson!

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.450
Oh?

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.320
Takao!

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:06.350
You did it, Takao! With this, our momentum is bound to come back!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.020
It's all thanks to you guys.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.700
Without Rei and Kai's advice, I would've been in serious trouble.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.850
And let's not forget your support.

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.340
How...

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.760
How could I lose?

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:25.140
You really need to ask
after throwing away your helmet?

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:26.690
You brought this on yourself.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:31.470
It's true. Steve's breakdown
is the main cause of his defeat.

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.860
But their power did go beyond our expectations.

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:37.080
Had my analysis overlooked something?

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:40.390
Director. There's a call from Secretary Douglas.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.890
It's me.

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:44.560
Care to explain what's going on, Director Judy?

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:47.000
Were you trying to put on
some sort of performance?

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.600
I am very sorry.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:53.100
I'm sure you already know that I have no interest in thrilling battles.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:55.660
Next time, settle it quickly.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:56.580
Understood.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:01.600
I'm sure my data analysis wasn't off..!

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:05.310
We <i>will</i> win the next battle.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:22.210
We're in the finals of the World Tournament's A-Block. Our first match ended with a win for the BBA team!

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:26.900
The exciting second set will feature Rei against Eddie!

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:30.520
Eddie, you have all the data you need, right?

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.330
Of course. It's all in here.

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:38.450
And unlike a certain someone, I'm not quick to let my blood go to my head.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:40.480
I'll get it done fast.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:43.750
And the stadium for their fight...

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:45.510
is this!

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:53.000
Developed in part with
NASA, it's America's space center!

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:57.540
It's a stadium shaped like a parabola antenna!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:01.440
But that's not all there is to it!
Look here, everybody!

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:08.350
It makes use of technology used by NASA in their low-gravity training!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.480
It's quite the special stadium!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:20.720
On this field, gravity is six times weaker than normal. It's just like being on the Moon.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.910
A normal Bey will run out of
power by simply being idle!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:28.410
It really is a battlefield fit only for a select few Beys!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.360
Interesting.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:31.660
Okay, let's start!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.040
Contestants, shoot stand-by!

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.550
The ball is the shooter?

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:41.600
Eddie appears to have
an innate sense for basketball...

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.900
yet we know nothing about the extent of his power.

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:46.730
Are you ready for this?

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.050
I know about you.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:50.560
And I mean everything.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.550
This guy...

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.840
Ready for the first battle?

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:58.730
Three, Two, One!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.690
Go... Shoot!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:16.630
Oh? Even Driger is struggling with the weaker gravitational pull!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:22.370
On the other hand,
Trypion shows its usual stability!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.450
W-What's with that Bey?!

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:28.570
How can it spin so fast on that unsteady field?

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:30.340
It's the Attack Ring!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.380
Look at that Attack Ring!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:36.040
Trypion's Attack Ring is acting as a propeller.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:41.410
By spinning so fast, it makes the Bey stick close to the ground, negating the push coming from below!

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:47.440
In other words, he fights no different in a stadium with reduced gravity than he would normally!

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.730
S-So then..!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:51.240
If the match drags on, Rei will be in trouble.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:55.230
Then I just gotta get it over with! Tiger Fang!

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:02.120
Here it is! Rei's secret technique, Tiger Fang!

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:04.920
What?!

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.760
T-Trypion dodged it!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.780
Driger is out!

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:26.740
Eddie wins! By dodging Rei's attack, Eddie achieves a skillful victory!

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:28.320
Impossible!

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:31.440
How could he see through my Tiger Fang?!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:34.200
Don't underestimate my kinetic vision.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:39.500
To a basket prodigy like me, you appear to move in slow motion.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:46.400
Basket is all about feints. To break through my defense, opponents will attempt all sorts of fakeouts.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:51.630
By this point, I've learned to
see through all kinds of fakeouts!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.440
Your Bey's movements...

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:57.390
are but a dance to me.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:05.640
I see. His innate talent for basket is not for power, but for dodging his opponent's attacks.

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:11.350
You shouldn't make light of Eddie's basketball talent. He already has a future as an NBA star.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:14.650
What's the biorhythm of Eddie and Trypion?

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.110
They're synchronized.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:19.530
Speed and power are both solid.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:23.910
Can you hear me, Eddie?
Enough with your warm-up. Go ahead and use <i>it</i>.

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:26.120
What? Already?

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:29.270
There's no point in wasting any more time on him.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:30.380
Very well.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.300
I wanted to have more fun with you,

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.620
though they want me to wrap it up.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:36.940
Too bad.

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.660
Contestants, shoot stand by!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.480
Do your best, Rei!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.920
Show them your true power!

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.790
Yeah, this guy's definitely strong!

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:51.400
This power is the real deal.
But there's no way I'll let myself lose!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.990
Second battle. Ready?

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:56.060
Three, Two, One!

00:16:56.060 --> 00:16:58.200
Go... Shoot!

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:05.840
Go, Driger!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:19.910
A Sacred Beast?!

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:21.730
The Sacred Beast of the Scorpion!

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:23.280
I knew it.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:26.650
It's over.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.710
D-Driger...

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:51.910
D-Driger is down! Eddie wins!

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:54.160
Alright, alright! That was easy!

00:17:54.160 --> 00:18:01.850
I'm not sure what happened, but with this, the American team wins the second set even before fighting its third battle.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.200
Rei-kun lost... How could this happen?

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:07.080
What formidable speed! What formidable power!

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:15.600
I'm sorry...

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:19.030
How? How the heck could you lose, Rei?!

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.480
You, who has traveled around the world fighting all kinds of opponents!

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:23.500
It's their data.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.100
We lost to their data.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:32.420
Even if his Bey is new, Rei has shown off his moves in countless occasions.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:37.130
In other words, they had more
than enough data on him.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.580
That's right. Strategy based
on an abundance of data.

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:43.790
As long as we have that,
the results are clear from the start.

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:48.980
And the one amongst you that we have the most data on...

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.110
is you, Max.

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:52.960
Mama...

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:58.360
The A-Block of the World Tournament is about to reach its final moments!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:05.630
Fighting the third set and aiming for the championship, it's Max of the BBA team!

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:09.160
And for the American team, Micheal!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:17.200
It's as we feared. So long as the PPB has data on us, we have no shot at winning.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.670
I'm sorry to say, but the
probability that Max will win is...

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:24.050
zero percent.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:26.570
T-That doesn't mean crap!

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:28.880
I don't know about probabilities or whatever,

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:32.580
but haven't we always brought out power beyond any calculation?

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.450
That's who we are!

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:35.750
Right, Max?

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.360
Am I... good enough?

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.400
Max...

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.840
For the sake of the team, it would be best to sent Kai, not me.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.640
They don't have any data on him, after all...

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:48.320
Indeed, if we want to win, that would be...

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:51.680
W-What the heck are you saying?! What's gotten into you guys?!

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:54.470
I'm pretty sure you came
to your conclusion long ago.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:56.760
Grandpa.

00:19:56.760 --> 00:20:01.160
I clearly remember that you decided Max-kun would fight in the final battle.

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:05.810
Having doubts this late into
the game is not like you at all.

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.220
Still...

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.080
Stop whining and go.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:13.240
Weren't you going to show them your power?

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.750
Go on out there, Max. You made a promise to your mother, yeah?

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.670
Max...

00:20:23.190 --> 00:20:26.160
Please... win this battle!

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:40.010
I'm going! I'm not sure of how far I'll be able to get, but I'll give it everything I've got.

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:49.110
Max... Do your best!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:56.660
As we thought; they're really sending out Max.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:59.270
Thank you, thank you! Leave it to me!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:01.500
Micheal, go get ready.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:02.660
Okay.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:06.420
Bring out all the data we have on Max.

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:07.490
Understood.

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:11.320
Max, I'll make quick work of you.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:15.080
It's the least I can do as a mother.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.460
Mama,

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:22.100
I will give it everything I have! With the Bit of Genbu that you gave me.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:01.000
According to my analysis, Max vs Micheal...

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:07.470
It's no good! Against overwhelming power, the first set ends with—Aaaah!—Micheal's victory.

00:23:07.470 --> 00:23:11.090
As if that wasn't enough,
he has a secret weapon, too!

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:17.230
Is this going to be the start of the new series, 'Bakuten Shoot PPB'?!

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:20.520
Next time: The Conclusion of The American Tournament!!

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:24.040
Max, now's the time to Go Shoot
your love to your mother!
